        "jsCode": "// The fixed test guests: their token starts with 7e57 (\"test\"). Real guests have random tokens and are never touched.\nconst rows = $input.all()\n  .map((item) => item.json)\n  .filter((row) => row && row.id !== undefined && /^7e57[a-f0-9]{60}$/.test(String(row.token || '')));\nreturn rows.map((row) => ({ json: { rowId: row.id } }));\n"
